{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>李玟（Coco，原名李美林）離世近三年，死因並未公開引起諸多揣測。</p><p>港媒6月24日報道，她的遺囑執行人已在24日正式入稟法院，起訴當時負責急救的醫生及香港消防處救護員，指控幾人涉嫌疏忽治療並依法求償。</p><figure><img alt=\"李玟近日驚傳不敵抑鬱症輕生，事件讓大眾更加關注精神健康。（fb@李玟）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753676785740288000782095.jpeg/QedZLC-3fKNfJBKN3yzvAL-hzshUsjG4bZKEHG2ShBw\"/><figcaption>李玟近日驚傳不敵抑鬱症輕生，事件讓大眾更加關注精神健康。（fb@李玟）</figcaption></figure><p>更多李玟Coco照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"李玟的二姐Nancy李思林透過律師發聲，呼籲外界給予尊重與空間。（FB圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753622457973215232381247.jpeg/RB7izaw2OgFQMcnPZDL4Zv2W0bi2dF2KsMn5xrDJ-cY\"/><figcaption>李玟的二姐Nancy李思林透過律師發聲，呼籲外界給予尊重與空間。（FB圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟是不少人的偶像代表。（李玟微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230707/753954081109708800468593.jpeg/vgqoOKCsHJBqCLg2fJtQQdKxctYbORiy-vQVBfr0FQU\"/><figcaption>李玟是不少人的偶像代表。（李玟微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230707/753934237266087936126973.jpeg/_t_1FPGkyHL8mEL_OqoAOVuyHHa44cpWNmCg2jZgoNo\"/><figcaption>李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"二姐透露，李玟個性冷靜不愛哭，而李玟則坦言「工作（有）壓力的時候」會向二姐哭訴。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753669807890632704697402.png/1dw1fJLK3TCeDVqXIBldkOupMSmh5SxD_4H7LP-B-yw\"/><figcaption>二姐透露，李玟個性冷靜不愛哭，而李玟則坦言「工作（有）壓力的時候」會向二姐哭訴。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟（李玟微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753669527438364672370581.jpeg/S6omUEkazX2SmcyBuG62OetwkVV4pxTNzLcXrsy3F64\"/><figcaption>李玟（李玟微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟登上《我是歌手》演繹《卧虎藏龍》主題曲〈月光愛人〉的片段（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753661080580132864790235.png/XmifFvq1VqC7rJlTwst2E9ibZVc1Sf1xy0IWgMtCFoA\"/><figcaption>李玟登上《我是歌手》演繹《卧虎藏龍》主題曲〈月光愛人〉的片段（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753623448390995968276308.jpeg/1YWOpreVjuxLUsCwDDeWRKit5T3T5AKOzXihzs14oc4\"/><figcaption>李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753623454456483840365029.jpeg/tblCk5Otlm6-nlqF5InWKdm-NQ1luqK7WD-Hslg_h7I\"/><figcaption>李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753623456973459456091627.jpeg/nKa5j3_ViJcbtBbRZuzmXPwOeYDIlQ0obodG426HRuM\"/><figcaption>李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753623459560951808761890.jpeg/cF1wmkUn0_4xQYVLZC6YMp8IFUcShmK3QKHG_kChxv4\"/><figcaption>李玟（微博@CoCo李玟）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟（IG@cocolee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753584133335289856906513.jpeg/pLBkDCu_Ju93rUUgGZChXR3QEjt4uPRE0hNhadITYWk\"/><figcaption>李玟（IG@cocolee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟（IG@cocolee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753585891196276736218963.png/LXm277wvxw_STICHijC6jWwkEFDhh-4AtRy7GLUcuxg\"/><figcaption>李玟（IG@cocolee）</figcaption></figure><p>消息曝光後引起熱議，李玟的二姐Nancy（李思林）隨後透過律師發表聲明，呼籲社會大眾切勿上傳、轉載案件細節，也不要發表誤導性評論或泄露家人資訊，希望外界給予尊重與空間。</p><p>她說：</p><p>李玟2023年7月5日離世，終年48歲。</p><p>Nancy當時說，「因為李玟不是病死，香港政府規定須要經過解剖」，後來傳出李玟的驟逝或許與疾病及前夫Bruce等因素有關。</p><p>【延伸閲讀】李玟Coco去世｜微博留最後身影　數月前躺牀「痛苦表情」惹心疼（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【相關圖輯】李玟Coco去世｜微博留最後身影　數月前躺牀「痛苦表情」惹心疼（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753661481186234368845327.png/STTs7DfWsrhQRJ1LOs7KhqGG9gNXT4hS9SioafUoqGk\"/><figcaption>【相關圖輯】李玟Coco去世｜微博留最後身影　數月前躺牀「痛苦表情」惹心疼（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614708736528384059268.png/TzN1wpvp2UhOulCFQQIb6axBs-lHEisA_T-JDf0_iQ0\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614711823667200061837.png/Yh5uNBulkHjumcB8OwEEeLnFezHxmisz3aT0Ad2k9AE\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614715158269952961852.png/82KeDPTqPtlVV3Y3KbYPxOnTKJHlDQh3zMugkszLoJI\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614717943418880128940.png/kVxFdy8knpWdnz_cvB4vHopBRX6TE7w050bNOudGzTo\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614720862785536839014.png/xUstAXVvFQ06avBt3R9gWbY5MIn6Ti1RFQY7HhUGOx4\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614724021227520827649.png/qm02CFETh2rEksoKR5qf_ruSjc2I_C2rwde3YsHXt2I\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614727309692928403152.png/I_DKl6uJlC5QJfltjuZVBgUTXOZasR2QUHz3s1B897M\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614729834795008675024.png/0TLpXteNYZs34G-f-fT-UMzx-efpc5lDR-gvL0foLy8\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614732590583808307129.png/2djnJv39kqG5priFfTFby3LjKjLjAeGBmnzyCpp88go\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614735539310592850324.png/7t5K3tvc_GAdZGgVxaE-9BWofEV35X7DRAOUsUQDlLE\"/><figcaption>李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李玟微博分享的復健畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230706/753614704806465536701984.png/UH_vYziY2yFiUsslAE6pe8_Lse0Np